# ============================================================
# REAL GMAIL OTP DELIVERY (Google SMTP)
# ============================================================
# To receive OTPs directly into your Gmail inbox:
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification
# 2. At the bottom, click "App passwords" (https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords)
# 3. Create an app named "StudentPlatform" and paste the 16-character password below
